repository.

It does not cover the base model or the datasets. microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct
is distributed by Microsoft under its own licence and is not redistributed here;
the adapter is a set of low-rank deltas that requires the base model to be
downloaded separately. The CNN/DailyMail and XSum corpora remain the property of
their original publishers and are not redistributed: the files under
results/summaries/ contain only generated summaries and an index.
